---
kind: lore
id: title
title: The title screen
---

// The title screen remembers the save: a fresh one, one with terms behind
// it, one that has cleared every route, and one that set the keeper free.

<beat id="fresh" on="title" title="A new save" once="false" when="user.terms == 0">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Lantern Academy. A single lantern burns on the lake behind the logo.
</beat>

<beat id="returning" on="title" title="A save with terms behind it" priority="10" once="false" when="@ngPlus && quest.fourLanterns.state != 'complete'">
  <match on="user.terms">
    <when is="1">
      @narrator{code="0010"}: Lantern Academy. One lantern floats on the lake behind the logo. A girl on the far jetty is watching it.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator{code="0020"}: Lantern Academy. {{user.terms}} lanterns float on the lake behind the logo. A girl on the far jetty is counting them.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>

<beat id="keeperWaits" on="title" title="Every route cleared" priority="20" once="false" when="quest.fourLanterns.state == 'complete' && !holds('cgSeen', ['cgKeeperEnd'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Lantern Academy. Every lantern on the lake is lit. On the far jetty, the girl has turned round, and is looking at you.
  @hotaru{code="0010" vo}: Next term. The one without a lantern.
</beat>

<beat id="freed" on="title" title="The keeper set free" priority="30" once="false" when="holds('cgSeen', ['cgKeeperEnd'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Lantern Academy. The lake is dark. On the jetty, a crowd of students, and one of them, in an old uniform, waves.
</beat>
